stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB

  state "待输入" as Idle
  state "解析中" as Parsing
  state "待补全" as NeedSlots {
    state "缺商品" as MissProduct
    state "缺客户" as MissPartner
    state "商品歧义" as Ambiguous
  }
  state "待确认" as Pending
  state "执行中" as Running
  state "成功" as Done
  state "失败" as Failed
  state "已拒绝" as Denied
  state "已取消" as Cancelled

  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Parsing : 提交一句话
  Parsing --> NeedSlots : 缺槽位 / 名称歧义
  NeedSlots --> Parsing : 用户补全或点选候选
  Parsing --> Denied : 无权限或不支持的动作
  Parsing --> Pending : 写操作（下单、审批、收款）
  Parsing --> Running : 只读查询（库存、报表）

  Pending --> Running : 用户确认
  Pending --> Cancelled : 用户取消 / 120 秒超时

  Running --> Done : 业务方法返回成功
  Running --> Failed : 库存不足 / 校验失败 / 异常

  Done --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
  Denied --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]

  note right of Pending
    确认令牌一次性、绑定用户
    重放或他人使用直接拒绝
  end note

  note right of Failed
    失败也要写审计，
    便于复盘「为什么没执行」
  end note
